OL,3,ASix killed in Krakow 'far-right'
OL,4,Ashooting, as three more bodies found in
OL,5,Aattacker's home
OL,6,
OL,7,FA gunman believed to have been inspired
OL,8,Fby far-right ideology has killed six
OL,9,Fpeople and injured more than a dozen
OL,10,Fothers in an attack in the busy centre
OL,11,Fof Poland's second largest city.
OL,13,FPolice said the attacker drove on to
OL,14,FMain Market Square in Krakow, a popular
OL,15,Ftourist attraction, on Saturday
OL,16,Fafternoon and fired randomly at people.
OL,18,FFour women and two men were killed.
OL,19,FThree were Polish, one was British and
OL,20,Ftwo have not been identified.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
